@infra_cap
title: Cap megacorp use of city infrastructure

The megacorps treat municipal life-support trunks, gravity-grid connectors, and transit corridors as free annexes.  We can demand formal allotments and force cutbacks above the cap.

- @infra_cap_generous: Generous allotment
- @infra_cap_fair: Fair allotment
